  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voices for Climate Action AMwA  Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AMwA envisions a dignified and equitable feminist society for African women, girls and gender-expansive persons.  AMwA under the Kenya VCA programme will realize this through advocating for Feminist alternatives being adopted as viable sustainable development models and systems at scale for economic and climate justice. For 5 years (2021-2025) AMwA&apos;s activities will be implemented through partnerships with local organizations that include; Siaya Mugano Network,  Women Empowerment Link,  CRAWN Trust, Lamu Women Alliance(LAWA)</narrative>
  </description>
